  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large clay pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and red bell pepper and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the potatoes, pineapple juice, beef broth, tomato paste, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then cover the pot and transfer it to the oven.",
    "Bake at 300°F for 2 hours, or until the meat is tender and the sauce is thick and gooey.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot."
  ],
